  "prefLabel": "Elec 301.02 Field experience",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 301.02 “Field experience” means time accumulated while performing electrical installations in the field under the direction of a master electrician. The term does not include time accumulated in a classroom setting or in the field as part of a course curriculum.\n\nSource. #12334, eff 7-22-17 (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Elec 300)",
